# Design System
- Use semantic design tokens instead of hardcoded product colors, spacing, radius, shadow or typography.
- Reusable visual values belong at the correct token layer.
- Components must remain readable in light/dark themes.
- Cover hover, active, focus, disabled and error states where applicable.
- Prefer logical CSS properties for RTL.
- Do not embed brand-specific styling in reusable components.
- Component-local tokens must map to system tokens.
